    "title": "Lofi sayori",
    "description": "sayori lofi\r\n\r\nAn AI-generated animated art. Man the only reason I did it is because not many people make lofi art of the DDLC girls. Like, c’mon man I just want a cool wallpaper. Feel free to use it or edit it.\r\n\r\n\r\n-It has animation\r\n*breathing\r\n*hair sway\r\n*Blinking\r\n*ceiling lamp swaying\r\n*Eyes follows the cursor\r\n\r\n-Has effects\r\n*vhs tape look cause its fitting for the game\r\n*sounds you can mute it if you want\r\n*Flickering on light bulb\r\n*Lights flickers on laptop and computer if sound is played\r\n*falling leaves by window is interactive\r\n*light can sometimes be seen in her eyes is it hope or is it something else\r\n*mist comes out from her mouth when she exhales to simulate the coldness of fall\r\n*X-ray\r\n\r\n-Scenery\r\n*Day\r\n    -Leaves falling\r\n    -Sun rays\r\n    -intractable leaves\r\n    -Horizon\r\n\r\n*Night\r\n    -Rain\r\n    -Reflection\r\n    -Light cursor ripple\r\n    -Light activity at the street street level and a window that flickers light when sound is played\r\n\r\n*V̸̾o̵͐i̸̓d̷\r\n\r\n-Music\r\n*Rain Ambience for Night\r\n*Lo-fi Type Beat - Dreaming by lee\r\n*Lo-fi Type Beat - Call Me by lee\r\n*Lo-fi Type Beat - I Need a Girl by lee\r\n*Lo-fi Type Beat - Wish by lee\r\n*Lo-fi Type Beat - Voice Mail by lee\r\n*Lo-fi Type Beat - It's just a dream by lee\r\n*Lo-fi Type Beat - Pink Rabbit by lee\r\n*Lo-fi Type Beat - Darling by lee\r\n\r\n-character\r\n*the girl her self Sayori\r\n\r\n\r\n\"The ai art really fits Sayori's Depression so well.\r\nat first glance the art seems to be normal looking and pretty even.\r\nBut as you scan the surroundings, you can see something is a bit off, a bit distorted. \r\nJust like Sayori's cheery personality it's a facade, in reality she suffers from severe depression.\r\nand her S̴̛͎̓d̷̖̣́͝u̷̦̞̽͊ỉ̶̗̏c̷̬̎̊i̷̪̓e̵͇̊͠ a̷͓̽͋ȇ̷̝̙m̵̫̒o̷̰̽ȅ̵̱͝e̶͙͇͐̍ ̶̠̥͠ ̶̯̐ș̷̋t̸͕͓̔̚h̵͍̓a̸͖͇̎̀g̵͔̋̕r̷̬͗̈́e̸̥͒͆d̴̯̾̉ẉ̴̇m̷͈̳̾ ofcourse I will not spoil it for you, if you haven't played it yet, but you can play the game and find out what it means.\"",
    "author": {
      "name": "",
      "steamId": "76561199074331198"
    },
